{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21421","headline":"诮卢戡与予数约游三寺戡独沈醉而不行 · 元稹","name":"诮卢戡与予数约游三寺戡独沈醉而不行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘兴无羁束，闲行信马蹄。\n路幽穿竹远，野迥望云低。\n素帚茅花乱，圆珠稻实齐。\n如何卢进士，空恋醉如泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}